          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"pricing.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Rates & Plans</title>\\n  <meta name='description' content='Transparent pricing for aromatherapy consultations, blends, and hybrid care.'>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#f6fbf9;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#6b7c73;--accent:#6fa18b;--accent-2:#8db6a3;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);--shadow:rgba(40,50,40,0.06);font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fffb 0%, var(--bg) 60%);color:#213233;line-height:1.45}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;background:transparent}\\n    .logo{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo svg{width:46px;height:46px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a[href$='pricing.html']{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white}\\n    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:28px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:stretch}\\n    .hero .lead{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.7),var(--glass));padding:28px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px var(--shadow);}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px}\\n    p.lead-desc{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .summary-card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px var(--shadow)}\\n\\n    .plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .plan{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff, #fbfffd);padding:22px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid rgba(120,140,130,0.06)}\\n    .plan h3{margin:0 0 6px 0}\\n    .price{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    ul.features{padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted);margin:12px 0}\\n\\n    .fineprint{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px}\\n    .cta-panel{margin-top:26px;display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .btn{padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}\\n    .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white}\\n    .btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(34,50,44,0.08)}\\n\\n    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:48px auto;padding:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* subtle decorative SVG background */\\n    svg#bgpattern{position:fixed;right:-10%;top:-6%;width:58vw;height:58vh;opacity:0.12;transform:rotate(8deg);pointer-events:none}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.plans{grid-template-columns:1fr}.logo svg{width:40px;height:40px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg id='bgpattern' viewBox='0 0 800 800' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>\\n        <stop offset='0' stop-color='#dff3ea'/>\\n        <stop offset='1' stop-color='#eaf7f0'/>\\n      </linearGradient>\\n      <pattern id='p1' width='120' height='120' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse' patternTransform='rotate(20)'>\\n        <rect width='120' height='120' fill='url(#g1)'/>\\n        <circle cx='18' cy='18' r='6' fill='#e0f1e8' />\\n        <circle cx='78' cy='78' r='6' fill='#f1fbf8' />\\n        <path d='M0 120 L120 0' stroke='#f7fdfb' stroke-width='2' opacity='0.6'/>\\n      </pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(#p1)' rx='80'/>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class='logo'>\\n      <svg viewBox='0 0 64 64' aria-hidden='true'>\\n        <rect x='6' y='6' width='52' height='52' rx='12' fill='#eaf7f0'/>\\n        <path d='M20 36c6-6 14-6 20 0' stroke='#6fa18b' stroke-width='3' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/>\\n      </svg>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Aroma care rooted in safety & calm</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n      <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>\\n      <a href='blends.html'>Blends</a>\\n      <a href='shop.html'>Shop</a>\\n      <a href='pricing.html' aria-current='page'>Rates</a>\\n      <a href='about.html'>Our Practice</a>\\n      <a href='book.html'>Schedule</a>\\n      <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class='hero'>\\n      <div class='lead summary-card'>\\n        <h1>Clear, compassionate pricing for aromatherapy support</h1>\\n        <p class='lead-desc'>We offer single consultations, package plans, and hybrid follow-ups so you can access aromatherapy safely in a way that fits your life. All sessions prioritize safety and education; no medical claims are made.</p>\\n\\n        <div class='cta-panel'>\\n          <button class='btn btn-primary' onclick='location.href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\"'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n          <button class='btn btn-ghost' onclick='location.href=\\\"contact.html\\\"'>Ask a question</button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='fineprint'>Sessions available in-person in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and via secure remote follow-up. Packages include step-by-step blending notes, dilution guidance, and patch-test support.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class='summary-card'>\\n        <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>Quick snapshot</h4>\\n        <div style='font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)'>Typical session length</div>\\n        <div style='font-weight:800;margin-top:6px'>60 minutes</div>\\n        <div style='margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Hybrid model: initial intake often 60–90m, follow-up 30–45m. Sliding scale available by request.</div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:26px'>\\n      <h2 style='margin:0 0 12px 0'>Plans built around practice and practice safety</h2>\\n      <div class='plans'>\\n        <div class='plan'>\\n          <h3>Intro Session</h3>\\n          <div class='price'>$95 — single</div>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted)'>60–75 min initial consultation; assessment, safe blend demo, patch-test guidance.</p>\\n          <ul class='features'>\\n            <li>Personalized blend suggestion</li>\\n            <li>Dilution & safety checklist</li>\\n            <li>Written notes & aftercare</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='plan'>\\n          <h3>Care Package (3 sessions)</h3>\\n          <div class='price'>$255 — package</div>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Two follow-ups + one initial intake. Ideal for establishing a routine and refinement.</p>\\n          <ul class='features'>\\n            <li>Blend refinements</li>\\n            <li>Progress notes</li>\\n            <li>30% discount on select roll-ons</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='plan'>\\n          <h3>Monthly Support</h3>\\n          <div class='price'>$85 / month</div>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Short monthly check-ins for ongoing adjustments and support (hybrid).</p>\\n          <ul class='features'>\\n            <li>30-min check-in calls</li>\\n            <li>Priority scheduling</li>\\n            <li>Email follow-ups</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style='margin-top:18px' class='summary-card'>\\n        <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>Sliding scale & community rates</h4>\\n        <p style='margin:0;color:var(--muted)'>I reserve a limited number of reduced-rate slots. If cost is a barrier, please contact {{EMAIL}} with a brief note.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:26px'>\\n      <h2 style='margin-bottom:10px'>Frequently asked pricing questions</h2>\\n      <div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px'>\\n        <div class='summary-card'>\\n          <strong>What’s included?</strong>\\n          <p style='margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)'>Written dilution guidance, patch-test instructions, and a plain-language blend recipe are included with every session.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='summary-card'>\\n          <strong>Cancellation policy</strong>\\n          <p style='margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)'>Please give 48 hours notice to avoid a 50% fee. Emergencies handled case-by-case.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:26px' class='summary-card'>\\n      <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>Ready to start?</h4>\\n      <p style='margin:0 0 12px 0;color:var(--muted)'>Book a session or send a quick message to discuss what will fit your needs.</p>\\n      <div class='cta-panel'>\\n        <button class='btn btn-primary' onclick='location.href=\\\"book.html\\\"'>Book a session</button>\\n        <button class='btn btn-ghost' onclick='location.href=\\\"contact.html\\\"'>Contact {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none'>{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name='description' content='Learn about our practitioner, our approach to aromatherapy, and safety-first principles.'>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#ffffff;--muted:#5f6a64;--accent:#7ba18a;--alt:#cfeee0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fcfffc 0%,#ffffff 40%);color:#15221f}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1000px;margin:28px auto;padding:22px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px 0}\\n    .nav{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);padding:8px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .nav a[href$='about.html']{background:rgba(123,161,138,0.12);color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}\\n    .hero{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}\\n    .portrait{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f6f9f6,#eef6ef);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:26px}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}\\n    section{margin-top:20px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px}\\n    .card{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(38,50,44,0.04)}\\n    .pillars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    .pill{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fbfff9,var(--alt));border-left:4px solid var(--accent)}\\n    .case-note{font-style:italic;color:var(--muted);padding-left:10px}\\n    .faq dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:12px}\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;cursor:pointer}\\n    .btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:white}\\n\\n    svg#pattern{position:fixed;left:-6%;bottom:-8%;width:48vw;height:48vh;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.portrait{width:96px;height:96px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg id='pattern' viewBox='0 0 600 600' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>\\n    <defs>\\n      <radialGradient id='rg' cx='30%' cy='30%'>\\n        <stop offset='0' stop-color='#eaf7f0'/>\\n        <stop offset='1' stop-color='#ffffff'/>\\n      </radialGradient>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(#rg)' rx='80'/>\\n    <g fill='none' stroke='#e6f2ea' stroke-width='3' opacity='0.9'>\\n      <path d='M50 500 C150 300 450 400 550 200'/>\\n      <path d='M0 320 C120 200 420 300 600 160'/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>\\n        <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav class='nav'>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Welcome</a>\\n        <a href='services.html'>Programs</a>\\n        <a href='blends.html'>Our Blends</a>\\n        <a href='about.html'>About</a>\\n        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <div class='hero'>\\n      <div class='portrait'>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Practical aromatherapy, designed around safety and clarity</h1>\\n        <div class='lead'>I combine plant oil knowledge with stepwise guidance so you can use scent safely at home. My approach centers on education, gentle testing, and documented aftercare.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class='grid'>\\n      <main>\\n        <section class='card'>\\n          <h3>Why a safety-first practice matters</h3>\\n          <p style='color:var(--muted)'>Essential oils are potent. My role is to help you understand concentration, interactions, and when to consult your primary care provider. I provide clear dilution charts and patch-test protocols with every plan.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h3>Misconceptions — quick clarifications</h3>\\n          <div style='display:grid;gap:8px'>\\n            <div style='background:#fbfff9;padding:10px;border-radius:8px'>\\n              <strong>Myth:</strong> More oil = better results.\\n              <div style='color:var(--muted)'>Truth: Use the minimum effective dose. Higher concentrations increase risk of irritation.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style='background:#fbfff9;padding:10px;border-radius:8px'>\\n              <strong>Myth:</strong> Natural always means safe.\\n              <div style='color:var(--muted)'>Truth: Natural extracts can be sensitizing. Context, dose, and individual history matter.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h3>PRACTICE PILLARS</h3>\\n          <div class='pillars'>\\n            <div class='pill'><strong>Education</strong> — Clear instructions and rationale for every blend.</div>\\n            <div class='pill'><strong>Testing</strong> — Patch testing and stepped exposures to reduce risk.</div>\\n            <div class='pill'><strong>Context</strong> — Consideration of medications, pregnancy, and pets.</div>\\n            <div class='pill'><strong>Documentation</strong> — Written recipes and dilution notes with each session.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h3>Anonymized case notes</h3>\\n          <div class='case-note'>\\\"Client A reported reduced nighttime restlessness after a low-concentration bedtime roll-on and structured patch-testing plan.\\\"</div>\\n          <div class='case-note' style='margin-top:8px'>\\\"Client B preferred inhalation supports; we co-developed a near-field inhaler and stepwise exposure log.\\\"</div>\\n          <div style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px'>Notes are educational and not medical advice.</div>\\n        </section>\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class='card'>\\n          <h4>Quick facts</h4>\\n          <ul style='color:var(--muted)'>\\n            <li>In-person: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</li>\\n            <li>Hybrid consults available</li>\\n            <li>Safe supply lists provided</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h4>FAQs</h4>\\n          <dl class='faq' style='color:var(--muted)'>\\n            <dt>How do you handle dilution?</dt>\\n            <dd>I give precise dilution percentages and step-by-step mixing instructions based on age, exposure route, and sensitivity.</dd>\\n            <dt>What about pets?</dt>\\n            <dd>We review safe use around animals and avoid nebulizing in shared spaces without consulting a vet.</dd>\\n          </dl>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h4>Connect</h4>\\n          <div style='color:var(--muted)'>Email: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n          <div style='margin-top:8px'><button class='btn btn-primary' onclick='location.href=\\\"book.html\\\"'>Schedule with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</button></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>\\n      <div style='flex:1' class='card'>\\n        <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>Want a plain-language introduction?</h4>\\n        <p style='margin:0;color:var(--muted)'>I offer a concise 30-minute orientation to safe home blending that covers dilution, patch testing, and basic storage.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <button class='btn btn-primary' onclick='location.href=\\\"book.html\\\"'>Book orientation</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style='margin-top:24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>\\n      {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — practicing with a focus on safety, clarity, and usable guidance. Phone: {{PHONE}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>Book — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name='description' content='Schedule a hybrid or in-person aromatherapy consultation with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}.'>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#f7fff9;--muted:#475a53;--accent:#5f9d7a;--accent-2:#2e6b53;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#ffffff);color:#10221e}\\n    .container{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)}\\n    nav a[href$='book.html']{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .hero{padding:18px;background:white;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 14px 36px rgba(20,30,26,0.06);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    h1{margin:0}\\n    .motto{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:18px;margin-top:14px}\\n    .option{background:white;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border-left:4px solid rgba(95,157,122,0.12)}\\n    .option h3{margin:0}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted)}\\n    form{background:white;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:14px}\\n    label{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-weight:700}\\n    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6eee7}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;border:none;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:12px;cursor:pointer}\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n\\n    svg#grid{position:fixed;right:0;top:20%;width:36vw;height:40vh;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.options{grid-template-columns:1fr}.row{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg id='grid' viewBox='0 0 600 600' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>\\n    <defs>\\n      <pattern id='dots' width='30' height='30' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'>\\n        <circle cx='3' cy='3' r='2' fill='#daf3e4'/>\\n      </pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(#dots)' rx='80'/>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class='container'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n        <a href='services.html'>Services</a>\\n        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n        <a href='contact.html'>Reach out</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <div class='hero'>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Book a hybrid aromatherapy session</h1>\\n        <div class='motto'>Hybrid options let us blend safely whether you're local to {{CITY}} or remote.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style='text-align:right'>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class='muted'>Aromatherapy practitioner • Safety-first</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class='options'>\\n      <div>\\n        <div class='option'>\\n          <h3>Initial Intake — 60–90 min</h3>\\n          <div class='muted'>Comprehensive history, safety screen, patch-test plan, and a personalized blend recipe.</div>\\n          <ul style='margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)'>\\n            <li>In-person or video</li>\\n            <li>Written dilution & instructions</li>\\n            <li>Supply & storage guidance</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='option' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h3>Follow-up — 30–45 min</h3>\\n          <div class='muted'>Adjustments, review of patch-test, and guided refinements.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='option' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h3>Orientation — 30 min</h3>\\n          <div class='muted'>Short intro to dilution, patch-testing, and basic at-home safety.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <form id='booking' onsubmit='handleSubmit(event)'>\\n          <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px 0'>Request an appointment</h4>\\n          <label for='name'>Name</label>\\n          <input id='name' name='name' required placeholder='Your full name'>\\n\\n          <label for='email'>Email</label>\\n          <input id='email' name='email' type='email' required placeholder='you@example.com'>\\n\\n          <label for='type'>Appointment type</label>\\n          <select id='type' name='type'>\\n            <option>Initial Intake (60–90m)</option>\\n            <option>Follow-up (30–45m)</option>\\n            <option>Orientation (30m)</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for='mode'>Preferred mode</label>\\n          <select id='mode' name='mode'>\\n            <option>Hybrid (video + materials)</option>\\n            <option>In-person ({{CITY}}, {{STATE}})</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for='notes'>Brief notes (concerns, pets, pregnancy, medications)</label>\\n          <textarea id='notes' name='notes' rows='4' placeholder='Any details to help prepare'></textarea>\\n\\n          <div class='row'>\\n            <button class='btn-primary' type='submit'>Request slot</button>\\n            <button type='button' style='background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(40,60,50,0.08);padding:10px;border-radius:10px' onclick='location.href=\\\"contact.html\\\"'>Message first</button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='note'>By submitting you consent to secure email follow-up. I will reply with availability and a short intake form. If you are pregnant or have a cardiac condition, please mention it so I can prioritize safety planning.</div>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class='option'>\\n          <h4>Before your appointment</h4>\\n          <ul style='color:var(--muted)'>\\n            <li>Complete the intake form sent after booking</li>\\n            <li>Prepare a short medication & allergy list</li>\\n            <li>Do not apply strong fragrances on the day</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='option' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h4>Safety notes</h4>\\n          <p class='muted'>We will always cover dilution, patch test steps, and safe use around pets. Sessions do not replace medical care; I do not diagnose or treat medical conditions.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='option' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h4>Quick FAQs</h4>\\n          <div style='color:var(--muted)'>\\n            <strong>Dilution?</strong> I provide precise dilution percentages and examples for common carriers.<br>\\n            <strong>Patch test?</strong> Yes — a step-by-step patch-test is part of the intake.\\n            <br>\\n            <strong>Pets?</strong> We discuss safe exposure and avoid nebulizing around animals; I recommend consulting your vet for specific concerns.<br>\\n            <strong>Pregnancy?</strong> We use conservative approaches and review up-to-date safety guidance; please note pregnancy in your form.\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='option' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <h4>Need help?</h4>\\n          <div style='color:var(--muted)'>Call: <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a><br>Email: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    function handleSubmit(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      const form = e.target;\\n      const data = new FormData(form);\\n      // lightweight UI acknowledgement; real booking handled by backend\\n      alert('Thanks — we received your request. ' + (data.get('mode') || '') + ' You will receive a confirmation at ' + data.get('email'));\\n      form.reset();\\n    }\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
